# src/api (subdirectory CLAUDE.md)

Loaded only when Claude reads a file under src/api/ - not at session launch,
unlike the root file. This is the mechanism a "new team member isn't getting
instructions" complaint usually traces back to: they're editing a file whose
directory-level CLAUDE.md was never loaded, or their own instructions live in
~/.claude/CLAUDE.md (user-level - never shared with teammates via version
control at all, by design).

@../docs/api-standards.md.example
